WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.400
The shining time...

00:08.570 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.900
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:49.420 --> 01:52.340
This is the painting you've been taking care of.

01:52.340 --> 01:54.670
Are you sure you want to sell it?

01:54.670 --> 01:58.300
We're a small company and we need to stave off bankruptcy.

01:58.300 --> 02:02.600
If we sell this painting, we can meet the payroll.

02:02.600 --> 02:07.020
I hate to part with it, so let me see it one last time.

02:30.830 --> 02:33.090
I'm not selling the painting.

02:33.090 --> 02:35.340
Hang it in this room.

02:36.960 --> 02:43.640
A Thief can Save a Corporation?!

02:43.640 --> 02:47.140
We have morning practice to go to now.

02:47.140 --> 02:48.890
YOU'RE LATE!

02:48.890 --> 02:52.110
You didn't have to wait for me.

02:52.110 --> 02:59.110
We have to go there early to prepare, or Pakkyamlamao-sensei will hang us again.

03:00.820 --> 03:04.280
Weeding the garden is no big deal.

03:04.280 --> 03:08.200
You're so naive, Maron. The weeding is all done.

03:09.410 --> 03:11.920
This time it'll be thirty laps around the field!

03:11.920 --> 03:14.380
We'll be fine if we take the shortcut!

03:17.670 --> 03:19.300
<i>I'm off!</i>

03:19.300 --> 03:22.840
<i>Ah, Miyako. Your ribbon isn't on right.</i>

03:22.840 --> 03:23.890
<i>Huh? Really?</i>

03:23.890 --> 03:26.470
<i>Here, I'll fix it for you.</i>

03:26.470 --> 03:30.940
<i>Oh, dear. You're in high school and you still tie your ribbon this way.</i>

03:30.940 --> 03:33.560
<i>It's okay, Mom. I can do it myself.</i>

03:33.560 --> 03:35.900
<i>Fine, fine. Off you go now.</i>

03:35.900 --> 03:38.230
<i>Don't keep Maron-chan waiting.</i>

03:39.070 --> 03:45.620
<i>To tell the truth, watching Miyako and her mom go through the same things every day is a drag.</i>

03:53.710 --> 03:57.090
"Today's morning practice is cancelled?!"

03:58.050 --> 04:00.340
C'mon, say somethin', Minazuki!

04:00.340 --> 04:02.840
That guy is your grandpa, right?

04:02.840 --> 04:05.640
The C.E.O. of Minazuki Group.

04:06.680 --> 04:09.140
What the hell are you guys doing?

04:09.140 --> 04:11.560
Ganging up on one person is unfair!

04:11.560 --> 04:16.650
Yeah, if you're going to fight, do it one-on-one!

04:16.650 --> 04:18.480
What are you talkin' about? Haven't you heard?

04:19.320 --> 04:20.440
About what?

04:21.280 --> 04:27.530
He's the grandson of the President of Minazuki Group, the company that's been in the news lately.

04:29.990 --> 04:37.540
Isn't the Minazuki Group the one that's infamous for hostile takeovers and bribing politicians?

04:40.710 --> 04:45.090
The Class President here is the heir to a huge company.

04:45.090 --> 04:46.800
I didn't know...

04:46.800 --> 04:53.850
He's the grandson of a wealthy, dishonest man. He has the same blood running through him.

04:54.940 --> 04:58.230
I wonder what the Class President has been doing behind our backs?

04:58.730 --> 05:00.020
So?

05:00.020 --> 05:00.900
That's why...

05:01.440 --> 05:08.700
First of all, there's no proof that the President of Minazuki Group has done anything yet!

05:08.700 --> 05:09.950
Well, yeah...

05:10.620 --> 05:17.630
Secondly, even if they found proof, the Class President has nothing to do with that!

05:17.630 --> 05:20.290
Are you saying that he did something?

05:20.290 --> 05:22.170
Well, uh...

05:22.170 --> 05:25.420
All I've heard are a bunch of false allegations!

05:29.350 --> 05:32.430
Come on, don't feel too bad.

05:32.430 --> 05:34.310
Thank you very much for savin--

05:34.310 --> 05:35.730
Sure, no problem.

05:36.480 --> 05:40.360
But my grandpa really has been acting strange.

05:40.360 --> 05:41.610
Strange?

05:41.610 --> 05:48.660
My grandfather is a stubborn man, but he always used to be a kind man, who put others before himself.

05:51.950 --> 05:53.490
<i>Listen closely, Yamato.</i>

05:53.490 --> 05:58.330
<i>When you're in charge of a company, you can't be concerned only with making profits.</i>

05:58.330 --> 06:02.290
<i>You have to look at the whole picture.</i>

06:02.290 --> 06:04.460
<i>The whole picture?</i>

06:06.090 --> 06:09.050
<i>That's the future.</i>

06:09.050 --> 06:10.010
<i>The future?</i>

06:10.010 --> 06:14.890
<i>What do you think is needed to achieve that future?</i>

06:16.480 --> 06:18.810
<i>People's hearts.</i>

06:18.810 --> 06:20.650
<i>People's hearts?</i>

06:20.650 --> 06:30.910
<i>When the hearts of workers and the hearts of consumers join together, a bright future is established.</i>

06:30.910 --> 06:37.330
<i>Therefore, it's not the profits, but the hearts of people that make up the foundation of a company's wealth.</i>

06:39.420 --> 06:43.290
<i>The people's hearts are the foundation of a company's wealth.</i>

06:47.920 --> 06:51.090
<i>It's huge, Yamato! Good job!</i>

06:54.390 --> 06:59.770
All of a sudden, it's <i>"Money, Money!"</i> I wonder what happened...

07:01.690 --> 07:04.860
Could this be the work of a Demon?

07:04.860 --> 07:11.320
The company is growing larger, but that's not my real grandpa.

07:11.320 --> 07:16.370
So, you're saying that it might be true that he's doing something illegal?

07:16.790 --> 07:18.200
Yes...

07:18.950 --> 07:22.210
And I really let those guys have it...

07:23.250 --> 07:24.670
I'm sorry.

07:24.670 --> 07:27.630
Don't worry, it's not your--

07:30.170 --> 07:31.260
Chiaki!

07:31.260 --> 07:34.050
Miyako, you're so righteous.

07:34.050 --> 07:37.970
The sight of a girl so passionate about a cause is beautiful.

07:37.970 --> 07:39.890
Really?

07:40.770 --> 07:44.900
It's better to know a girl's thoughts than to not know them.

07:44.900 --> 07:47.730
Sorry for not being beautiful.

07:48.650 --> 07:54.740
<i>He says he doesn't know what I'm thinking, but he acts as if he knows everything.</i>

07:54.740 --> 07:56.160
<i>I have to be careful.</i>

07:57.450 --> 08:01.790
Maron, are you thinking about what I just said?

08:01.790 --> 08:06.210
What did you say? You're so full of yourself!

08:06.210 --> 08:07.380
You think so?

08:07.380 --> 08:09.340
<i>He pisses me off!</i>

08:10.460 --> 08:15.680
Class President, as long as you stand tall, the gossip about your grandpa has nothing to do with you.

08:15.680 --> 08:16.800
Are you sure...?

08:17.470 --> 08:21.480
If you have something to say, try telling your grandpa.

08:27.150 --> 08:29.730
<i>What's this? I guess he can be a nice guy sometimes.</i>

08:29.730 --> 08:32.650
Way to go, Chiaki! That's the--

08:32.650 --> 08:33.780
Sure!

08:44.920 --> 08:48.340
President Minazuki, I beg of you...

08:48.340 --> 08:52.210
If you would just wait on this payment, my company will...

08:52.210 --> 08:57.470
Your company couldn't survive the competition. Bankruptcy is inevitable.

08:57.470 --> 09:05.270
Minazuki-kun, we've been friends since childhood. We have helped each other out...

09:05.270 --> 09:09.480
Friendship is a bunch of crap! Get out!

09:12.990 --> 09:16.110
It's the rule of business. I don't have time for sweet talk.

09:16.110 --> 09:18.990
It's the age of the survival of the fittest.

09:18.990 --> 09:23.660
The strong survive and the weak just die.

09:23.660 --> 09:26.790
The company grows by gaining profits.

09:33.260 --> 09:34.970
This is too much!

09:34.970 --> 09:36.800
He's just a tyrant now.

09:36.800 --> 09:42.970
I came to this company because of his reputation. But he's changed so much.

09:45.140 --> 09:47.350
We're taking over this hospital next.

09:52.480 --> 09:53.570
Yamato.

09:54.320 --> 09:55.900
I'm busy now.

09:55.900 --> 09:57.990
G-Grandpa, I have to talk to you...

10:01.950 --> 10:06.250
G-Grandpa, stop making profits at the expense of others.

10:06.250 --> 10:07.660
Stop!

10:08.580 --> 10:12.920
What would a child like you know? You, kick him out!

10:12.920 --> 10:13.840
Yes, sir!

10:13.840 --> 10:15.550
Now... Yamato-kun.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.230
Fin!

10:37.190 --> 10:40.160
Why are you relaxing and having a cup of milk?

10:40.160 --> 10:41.570
I haven't had any yet...

10:41.570 --> 10:47.290
- Never mind! The President of Minazuki Group...

10:43.910 --> 10:53.210
- Despite the protests of the people, President Minazuki is buying a local hospital and building an amusement park.

10:54.340 --> 10:57.010
No doubt about it, this is the work of a Demon!

10:57.010 --> 10:59.550
Throwing out the Class President like that...

10:59.550 --> 11:00.720
The Class President?

11:07.310 --> 11:09.520
Hello, this is the Kusakabe's. To whom am I--

11:09.520 --> 11:10.440
<i>It's Minazuki.</i>

11:11.400 --> 11:17.110
Um, I tried telling my grandfather what I thought,

11:17.110 --> 11:21.110
but I got scared and couldn't do it.

11:21.110 --> 11:23.870
Class President, so your grandpa--

11:29.200 --> 11:31.540
Fin? Fin?

11:46.350 --> 11:48.970
Notice

11:46.350 --> 11:48.970
Don't go away!

11:46.350 --> 11:48.970
I'll return right after these messages!

11:46.350 --> 11:48.970
Kaitou Jeanne

11:49.850 --> 11:52.480
Notice

11:49.850 --> 11:52.480
I'm back to continue my adventures

12:01.070 --> 12:05.070
What?! Jeanne sent a notice to the Minazuki Group?

12:05.070 --> 12:06.740
Let's move!

12:06.740 --> 12:07.830
Yes, sir!

12:12.290 --> 12:15.580
Hey! Kaitou Jeanne sent out another notice card!

12:15.580 --> 12:16.790
What?

12:16.790 --> 12:21.050
This time she's after President Minazuki's famous painting.

12:22.510 --> 12:24.050
She's done it again!

12:24.050 --> 12:28.060
I know! Jeanne makes you mad, too.

12:28.060 --> 12:34.020
The police department created a Special Jeanne Task Force, however...

12:37.730 --> 12:39.980
Now, I have to start planning.

12:39.980 --> 12:41.360
I'm leaving early!

12:45.990 --> 12:49.200
You're being punished for doing things on your own.

12:49.200 --> 12:52.500
That's because you won't initiate things on your own.

12:52.500 --> 12:55.710
You are the only one who can seal Demons.

12:55.710 --> 13:03.090
It's impossible. Minazuki Group only cares about protecting their profits.

13:03.090 --> 13:05.180
I don't stand a chance.

13:20.150 --> 13:21.530
Class President...

13:24.860 --> 13:27.860
Fin, we must devise a plan.

13:27.860 --> 13:29.200
What?!

13:33.790 --> 13:35.620
It's time now, Maron.

13:36.330 --> 13:37.420
Right.

13:41.590 --> 13:45.170
Oh, Maron. Where are you going at this hour?

13:45.170 --> 13:49.010
Ah... Just out for a bit. What about you, Miyako?

13:49.010 --> 13:52.010
Naturally, I'm going to catch Jeanne!

13:53.560 --> 13:57.060
What determination! I wish you luck!

13:57.060 --> 14:00.650
Thanks! I'm definitely going to catch her!

14:04.820 --> 14:08.360
If you don't hurry up, you won't make the time on the notice!

14:08.360 --> 14:09.610
I know.

14:19.790 --> 14:25.960
The enemy is elusive. Prepare for any possible entry.

14:25.960 --> 14:26.880
Yes!

14:28.010 --> 14:29.840
Point A, check.

14:29.840 --> 14:33.600
We must uphold our honor as police and arrest Jeanne.

14:33.600 --> 14:34.810
Yes!

14:38.640 --> 14:41.150
This is more heavily guarded than we thought.

14:41.150 --> 14:46.740
It's a big company, so the police couldn't settle for average protection.

14:46.740 --> 14:48.900
Next, Point B, check.

14:53.370 --> 14:55.870
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

15:06.300 --> 15:08.260
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

15:08.260 --> 15:09.880
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

15:09.880 --> 15:11.720
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:14.180 --> 15:20.310
How foolish of her to try stealing my 500,000,000 yen painting.

15:20.310 --> 15:24.190
I spent millions on my security system.

15:24.190 --> 15:27.530
Jeanne doesn't stand a chance.

15:27.530 --> 15:29.530
I'd like to see her try.

15:33.820 --> 15:39.000
Well, compared to the painting, I can afford to spend this much.

15:39.000 --> 15:42.750
I've been making more money than I can spend.

15:46.460 --> 15:48.130
Next, Point C, check.

15:48.130 --> 15:49.170
Roger!

15:50.550 --> 15:52.010
Is that so?

15:52.010 --> 15:55.100
Then, there isn't anything for us to do.

15:55.100 --> 16:01.310
What?! I pay a lot of taxes and I expect you to do your job!

16:01.310 --> 16:02.480
But...

16:02.480 --> 16:05.480
Then, I want you to show more trust in us.

16:05.480 --> 16:06.400
Yeah.

16:09.440 --> 16:10.820
Point D, check!

16:10.820 --> 16:11.900
Roger!

16:32.920 --> 16:34.050
Jeanne, it's the police!

16:35.260 --> 16:36.140
Police!

16:36.140 --> 16:36.930
Class President!

16:36.930 --> 16:37.600
Hey!

16:37.600 --> 16:38.470
Cut the power!

16:38.470 --> 16:39.390
Yes, sir!

16:41.930 --> 16:43.770
Class President, what are you doing here?

16:43.770 --> 16:45.900
Yamato, did you come to disturb me?

16:46.900 --> 16:50.610
No, I was worried about you.

16:50.610 --> 16:53.990
Worry more about yourself than others.

16:53.990 --> 16:56.570
Now, it's time for Jeanne to show up.

16:56.570 --> 16:58.570
Activate the sensors!

16:59.490 --> 17:01.660
Come if you dare!

17:04.710 --> 17:06.830
Fin, Point E, check!

17:06.830 --> 17:07.920
Roger!

17:07.920 --> 17:10.250
Oh, it's Jeanne!

17:11.130 --> 17:13.720
Sir, it's Jeanne. Jeanne has arrived!

17:13.720 --> 17:16.800
She went through the vent and is headed your way!

17:26.730 --> 17:27.770
Push, push harder!

17:30.520 --> 17:31.980
Fin, it's about time.

17:31.980 --> 17:33.030
Okay.

17:41.700 --> 17:42.450
What happened?

17:42.450 --> 17:44.750
The primary power supply has been destroyed!

17:45.580 --> 17:50.590
Without electricity, this state-of-the-art security system is useless!

17:50.590 --> 17:55.130
State-of-the-art machines just work that way.

17:55.130 --> 18:00.640
Don't be so calm! The painting! Is the painting all right?

18:00.640 --> 18:02.470
Will you please be quiet?

18:04.520 --> 18:07.810
Just as I expected. Come when you please, Jeanne.

18:08.440 --> 18:11.110
Fin, time for the next step of the plan.

18:11.110 --> 18:11.900
Okay!

18:18.150 --> 18:19.860
Hey, something's wrong!

18:20.700 --> 18:22.030
It's electrical interference!

18:35.760 --> 18:37.720
Fin, are you ready?

18:37.720 --> 18:38.930
Whenever you are!

19:19.090 --> 19:19.970
What the...?

19:27.390 --> 19:30.230
My painting! Quick, do something!

19:30.230 --> 19:32.190
Cut the power to the sensors!

19:32.190 --> 19:35.860
Don't cut the power! That's Jeanne's plan!

19:38.150 --> 19:39.940
Hurry up, and get these guys out of here!

19:39.940 --> 19:40.780
Yes, sir!

19:45.990 --> 19:47.200
<i>Checkmate!</i>

19:53.040 --> 19:55.170
Miyako Special, Part Four!

19:56.460 --> 20:00.260
I knew you were going to cut the power and come through the vent.

20:00.970 --> 20:02.380
There's no way out!

20:02.380 --> 20:05.510
Now Jeanne, reveal your identity!

20:05.510 --> 20:07.850
It's all over, Jeanne!

20:07.850 --> 20:11.310
What am I going to do? If Miyako finds out my identity...

20:11.310 --> 20:13.560
Now, stay silent.

20:24.030 --> 20:27.370
Kaitou Sinbad has arrived.

20:37.210 --> 20:39.800
Hurry, turn the power back on! Hurry!

20:42.130 --> 20:44.010
Maron! Hurry up and <i>Checkmate!</i>

20:44.010 --> 20:44.970
Right!

20:46.550 --> 20:48.390
In the name of God...

20:50.970 --> 20:53.440
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:53.440 --> 20:54.850
- The painting is mine!

20:58.730 --> 21:00.070
A black pin!

21:00.070 --> 21:05.410
Kaitou Jeanne, I plan to steal all your targets!

21:05.410 --> 21:06.280
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:18.960 --> 21:21.840
What are you doing? Turn the emergency power back on!

21:21.840 --> 21:22.840
I'll take that!

21:28.470 --> 21:32.020
Damn! She got away again!

21:34.100 --> 21:36.060
We were robbed!

21:36.600 --> 21:42.110
"Money is the company." Who rewrote this?

21:43.110 --> 21:44.740
Grandpa!

21:46.280 --> 21:51.870
Kaitou Sinbad... Why did he get in my way?

21:51.870 --> 22:00.670
Who is he?! The only one who can seal Demons is Maron, the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc!

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.050 --> 23:34.760
Miyako, let's go to the World Treasure Exhibit tomorrow...

23:34.760 --> 23:36.390
No, I have a job to go to...

23:36.390 --> 23:39.430
We need to guard the "Tear of Aegean Sea," which is going to be on display.

23:39.430 --> 23:42.020
- What job?? You're still a high school student!

23:41.140 --> 23:42.020
- What did you say???

23:42.020 --> 23:44.690
N-Nothing! Maybe this time, Jeanne won't come...

23:44.690 --> 23:47.690
She'll definitely come! It's the instinct of a police officer's daughter!

23:47.690 --> 23:51.360
Jeanne! The security is perfect - I'll show it to you!

23:51.360 --> 23:54.700
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Emergency Warning at the Airport.

23:54.700 --> 23:59.290
Sorry, Miyako, but I'll take this deceptive beauty!
